        Habilis-$β$: A Fast-Motion and Long-Lasting On-Device <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Action</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span>
      
